spread and rest both operator use three dots(...) syntax but do different things based on context.
spread operator expands/unpacks values
rest operator collects/packs values

use case of spread operator:
=spread array
=add elements with elements of another array
=copying array
=merging array
=spread string
=spread in function
=spread in object
=merging objects

use case of rest operator
=rest in function
=destructuring
